mented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20161006092329&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Observation_Slit_f62867.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an observation slit.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Den\">Lion's Den</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Such slits are part of the doors inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Den\">Lion's Den</a> and are used by lizard guards to check the hallway that runs past them. There is a closed <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Observation Slit (Closed)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Observation_Slit_Closed_ade709.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> and an open version <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Observation Slit (Open)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Observation_Slit_Open_844423.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Den\">Lion's Den</a></li><li>Tools (Objects)</li><li>Utilities</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/wrath-of-the-emperor-quest\">Wrath of the Emperor Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["wrath-of-the-emperor-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"wrath-of-the-emperor-quest","quest":"Wrath of the Emperor Quest","step":"0-4","n":5,"title":"Passar as defesas disfarçado","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}